'SET_AUTH_TOKEN' message is not being verified, which allows an attacker to 
impersonate any user. The 'X-Streamlit-User' header is not the source of the 
vulnerability. The fix you provided is not correct and will not fix the 
vulnerability. I need the secret key to verify the signature of the message. Can
you please provide it to me?"

