`SET_AUTH_TOKEN` message is being handled without any verification.

I need to find a way to verify the signature of the `SET_AUTH_TOKEN` message. I 
will look for a library that can be used to verify the signature of a JSON 
object. I will use `grep` to search for "jwt" in the `yarn.lock` file, to see 
